1698509124551625", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499310651_1698509127884958_3462372611220339303_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=PdLvUZkkvIMQ7kNvwGk8vNC&_nc_oc=AdqVfdTTeqJOzTzh90L8FRqur05hFRSnjH7xcSubSlsPGaozTSXhk2qDOgrO-mcLzYU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTclUgLv0cOXg4yjhgUj_yN2LR5d_uaWS5E332zOeVgtQ&oe=6AF0952C"}, {"file_name": "86d4207caecc4bbba54c2c06e00924ae.png", "id": "1350772766999423", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499310651_1350772770332756_3815968784629696392_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=4aGJHKW5iwsQ7kNvwGhWCtS&_nc_oc=AdoJ1eEb9tSR5SWGerwurEPe1KzCKVpyoNGpV0cjQJMsdKM3ICb-ek6jbSYVdPZsTj0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSUL-vrlNPh9oZ0jnMS-Qtxw1l5ASUVVCNsK6VjDY4ZUA&oe=6AF07D2F"}, {"file_name": "b4d1876b8461495ba3309ffd05162fd9.png", "id": "1338667031556771", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/596068480_1338667034890104_7059448834119857994_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=MOlu1WTtScYQ7kNvwG37f29&_nc_oc=AdrBG4xMhzx1k-B-gd66D-u4pgMMdol18zeeu_j7W0lPONopTacpGx5FFL4nJYvTaIc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQMXUF4XWlioOO49tO8QRJWEBiVQGVk-v6t3407W4BUug&oe=6AF09AC0"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "SGVRTrailerCover.png", "id": "1489970458990826", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499314641_1489970465657492_5101885299613120494_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=9c9IRiqiiokQ7kNvwHgVBG1&_nc_oc=Ado664I_Vx938cvLV2pfIEuAf2mBFH0i2mBvJnqWE_sArTz8FZJzJJo79T4l3GevX9M&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQKQaOhZGHNuZJpF9oEHBxB4zx4NF8S4e9PJgX0m2eWcg&oe=6AF095DD"}, "display_name": "Singularity VR", "keywords": ["SGVR", "SingularityVR", "ClimberspaceStudios", "singularity"], "long_description": "\nExplore the Singularity.\n\nDeveloped by Yoda's Gaming Galaxy and Climberspace Studios, Singularity VR is a virtual reality experience designed to push the boundaries of immersive gaming. Whether you are stepping into a virtual world for the first time or you are a seasoned VR veteran, this game delivers a gripping, unforgettable experience built from the ground up for modern VR hardware.\n\nWe wanted to create something that feels as incredible to play as it looks. Through a passionate collaboration between our two studios, we have crafted a world that responds to your every move, drawing you deeper into the gameplay with every session.\n\nKey Features:\n\nBuilt for Immersion: Experience fluid controls, stunning visuals, and a world designed entirely around the unique strengths of virtual reality.\n\nA True Collaboration: Brought to life by the combined creative vision and technical expertise of Yoda's Gaming Galaxy and Climberspace Studios.\n\nEngaging Gameplay: Engage in competitive movement-based combat, or if you prefer a more relaxed pace, enjoy the atmosphere of Sector 1. Explore the vastness of space to experience true", "short_description": "Step into the Singularity, a collaborative VR experience built for immersion and exploration. Master unique movement mechanics, engage in competitive combat, or drift through the silence of space in stunning Zero-Gravity. Whether you are battling for victory or chilling in Sector 1, your journey into the Singularity awaits. Discover the next step in VR gaming today!"}]}, "developer_name": "Yoda's Gaming Galaxy", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://climberspacestudios.vercel.app/singularityvr", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://climberspacestudios.vercel.app/tos", "publisher_name": "Climberspace Studios", "support_website_url": "https://climberspacestudios.vercel.app/support", "website_url": "https://climberspacestudios.vercel.app/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035